# Process-local proof that the shipped Level 2 basic-thread commands route
# into the direct CCinematicThread/CBoss reconstructions. Cinematic 20017
# issues Throwing for Rhino 20019 and object 1177. Cinematic 20020 stops that
# action and starts the native CProgressBar chase from waypoints 20071/20080.
fixed_step_ms 50
sample_interval_ms 50
capture_interval_ms 0
max_time_ms 10000
start_time_ms 0
render_size 640 360

wait_gameplay 1000
start_cinematic 20017
wait_cinematic_started 1000 20017
wait 3700
start_cinematic 20020
wait_cinematic_started 1000 20020
wait 1800
capture level2-progress-command
finish
